# suite TAPINVREG register and dups
ok 1 - a coded invoice validates
ok 2 - the calculated net is 250.00
ok 3 - input VAT at 20 per cent is 50.00
ok 4 - the gross agrees with the supplier
ok 5 - nothing is left to explain on the net
ok 6 - an unapproved non-PO category is held
ok 7 - the non-PO exception is named
ok 8 - the held line is reported on the line
ok 9 - a 25.00 difference is not accepted
ok 10 - the difference is quantified
ok 11 - an impossible receipt date is refused
ok 12 - the genuine invoice is registered
ok 13 - registration completes without an error code
ok 14 - it is given a register number
ok 15 - it is not yet eligible for payment
ok 16 - case and spacing do not make a new document
ok 17 - the earlier registration is found
ok 18 - the clerk is pointed at the earlier entry
ok 19 - a duplicate is refused, not warned about
ok 20 - the refusal quotes the duplicate rule
ok 21 - registering it again is refused
ok 22 - the attempt is marked as a duplicate
ok 23 - no second register number is issued
ok 24 - a different reference is not a duplicate
ok 25 - the same amount and date are reported
ok 26 - the similar document is only a warning
ok 27 - the warning quotes the similar document rule
ok 28 - the earlier register number is offered
ok 29 - the reviewed document is registered
ok 30 - it gets its own register number
1..30
# TAPINVREG register and dups passed 00030 failed 00000
# exit 0
